'''Agama'gor'''{{coords|44|50|Barrens|link=Barrens}} was a large [[Bristleback tribe|Bristleback]] [[quilboar]] settlement located just north of the road leading west from [[Camp Taurajo]]. Its close proximity to the camp makes it a convenient area to grind for [[Blood Shard]]s which are dropped by Bristleback quilboar [[mob]]s and can be returned to the exile [[Mangletooth]] for temporary [[buff]]s.

